      "description": "The 23-ws-protocol.md 8.4 ladder: drop, drop_share, unmergeable and resnapshot count per topic; close_budget and close_redrop per close (a slow_consumer close, which the closes panel and WsSlowConsumerClosed see too); close_flush_deadline per close whose flush expired, beside its step 3; withdrawn per queued frame that a withdrawn grant or permission dropped (9.5). The ladder runs only with CV_WS_BACKPRESSURE_ENABLED on; with it off only close_flush_deadline and withdrawn move. A reason's series starts at its first event, so the first one after a restart may not show.",
